    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy the unknown evil that lies within the Sepulcrum!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a powerful team of adventurers - over 20 unique characters to choose from, with varying powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find powerful weapons and magic items - or purchase them with the gold you have looted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect legendary artefacts and build powerful synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight many and varied foes along the way - from Bandits through to rare and fearsome beasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non combat encounters with decisions that may help or hinder your quest...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runs take about 90 minutes max. New Adventurers, Artefacts and difficulty levels to unlock!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy the unknown evil that lies within the Sepulcrum!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a powerful team of adventurers - over 20 unique characters to choose from, with varying powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find powerful weapons and magic items - or purchase them with the gold you have looted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect legendary artefacts and build powerful synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight many and varied foes along the way - from Bandits through to rare and fearsome beasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non combat encounters with decisions that may help or hinder your quest...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runs take about 90 minutes max. New Adventurers, Artefacts and difficulty levels to unlock!</p>",
